{"id":"n65661-1-16","stage":3,"title":"승차권 · 乘车票","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65661-1-16-1","ko":"제가 승차권을 잃어버렸는데, 어떻게 하죠?","zh":"我弄丢了车票，该怎么办呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"승차권을","meaning":"乘车票，车票","explanation":"승차권：乘车票，车票；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"승차권","audio":"/audio/7c24aafe4d86be63867c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65661","senseId":"1","lemma":"승차권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승차권을","audio":"/audio/114be94d5db9c579ffca.mp3"}},{"text":"잃어버렸는데,","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버렸는데","audio":"/audio/9e2cce2cd0eedcdc4b3f.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"하죠?","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하죠","audio":"/audio/1c8f7452b1a82fa0732b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"7c24aafe4d86be63","term":"승차권","zh":"乘车票，车票","audio":"/audio/7c24aafe4d86be63867c.mp3","entryId":"65661","definition":"为了乘车而买的票。","pronunciation":["승차꿘"]},{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4922507b513d374cde63.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65661-1-16-2","ko":"죄송하지만 그러면 버스에 탑승하실 수 없습니다.","zh":"很抱歉，那样的话您就无法上车了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송하지만","audio":"/audio/8f5e03e932bf717d558b.mp3"}},{"text":"그러면","meaning":"那么，那样的话","explanation":"그러면：那么，那样的话。","readings":[{"term":"그러면","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58276","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러면","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3"}},{"text":"버스에","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스에","audio":"/audio/f8530cd07494c8575198.mp3"}},{"text":"탑승하실","meaning":"搭乘，乘坐","explanation":"탑승하다：搭乘，乘坐；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"탑승하다","audio":"/audio/eee32d4af87ec45fef30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82758","senseId":"1","lemma":"탑승하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"탑승하실","audio":"/audio/ac95a064b25b493a167f.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"없습니다.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없습니다","audio":"/audio/795d658e7bfcf08e6bc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"25763f89d255f125","term":"그러면","zh":"那么，那样的话","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3","entryId":"58276","definition":"用于表示前文为后文的条件。","pronunciation":["그러면"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"eee32d4af87ec45f","term":"탑승하다","zh":"搭乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/eee32d4af87ec45fef30.mp3","entryId":"82758","definition":"坐飞机、船、车等。","pronunciation":["탑씅하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d09dc032b67fdeacfb4f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.169,"so